<title>USA: Ford unit Hertz Corp sets $150 mln notes.</title>
<headline>Ford unit Hertz Corp sets $150 mln notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Hertz Corp, a unit of Ford Motor Corp, was priced on Wednesday, according to lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
<p>BORROWER HERTZ CORP</p>
<p>AMT $ 150 MLN	COUPON 6.30 PCT   MATURITY 11/15/2006</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.647  FIRST PAY DATE N.A.</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A3    YIELD 6.371 PCT   PAY FREQ	 N.A.</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-A  SPREAD 39 BP	PUTABLE IN THE SIXTH YEAR</p>
<p>UNDERLYING: 6.375 PERCENT U.S. TREASURY NOTE DUE 2002</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1678</p>
</text>
